-- Values to test with, and smaller values to try when one fails: the crate's
-- `src/arbitrary.rs`.
--
-- Where the crate has a trait, this has a record, `Arbitrary a`, passed by
-- hand. Generating performs `Std.Random`, so `withSeed` makes a run repeatable;
-- with no handler the runtime supplies entropy, as the crate's `Gen` does.
